OL,3,GNEWSATeen took own life after care
OL,4,Adelays, inquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager apparently took her own life
OL,7,Fafter NHS mental health teams did not
OL,8,Fimmediately involve a psychiatrist in
OL,9,Fher care, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FIschia Montagu La Placa, 16, was found
OL,12,Fdead at her home in Lyme Regis, Dorset,
OL,13,Fon 16 February 2024.
OL,15,FShe met NHS crisis workers but did not
OL,16,Fsee a psychiatrist despite a series of
OL,17,Fself-harm incidents in the weeks before
OL,18,Fher death, the inquest in Bournemouth
OL,19,Fwas told.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
